# Wauvio voice profile. Every value is explicit; edit and load with load_profile().
voice mio
display Mio (澪)
language ja
notes Calm, warm and smooth: a slightly darker, rounder cousin of Yune with a touch more breath, steady slower vibrato and gentle glides; soft consonants, flowing legato.
natural_amount 0.27

# model
model_name Mio: calm, warm Japanese female
range 51 86 40 94
vowel a 867 1458 2955 140 135 198 1 0.85 0
vowel i 325 2807 3448 99 156 208 1 0.45 0
vowel u 364 1428 2709 104 130 187 1 0.45 0
